# ============================================================
# Learing Web - .gitignore
# ============================================================
# Exclude generated, user-specific, and secret files

### .NET build artifacts ###
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
*.user
*.suo

### IDE ###
.vs/
.vscode/
*.idea/

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Logs ###
*.log
*.txt

### Connection strings — NEVER commit!
ConnectionStrings.config

### SQL dump files ###
*.sql

### Local environment ###
.env
.env.local
